        "text": "=Evaluate this job alert email body:\\n{{ $json.snippet }}\\n\\nCandidate Profile: Senior Automation Engineer & Python/Typescript Developer with n8n and AI workflow expertise.\\nProvide: 1) Score (0-100), 2) Recommendation (Apply / Skip), 3) Key matching keywords."
      },
